-- Comments
comment on column public.cars.identity_source is 'How the vehicle identity was established: picker (catalog selection), vin (decoded), manual (typed). Null on pre-0041 cars.';
comment on column public.cars.cover_focal_x is 'Cover framing focal point, 0..1 from the left. Null = center. Render-only (0043).';
comment on column public.cars.generation_id is 'The car''s generation. Resolved from catalog_model_id + year when exactly one generation covers the year; otherwise null until the owner chooses.';
comment on column public.cars.generation_source is 'resolved (the one generation covering model + year) or owner (the owner chose it). Null when generation_id is null.';

